{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"God, the|strong=\"H7760\"nations|strong=\"H1471\"have|strong=\"H1471\"come into|strong=\"H7760\"your|strong=\"H7760\"inheritance|strong=\"H5159\".  \nThey|strong=\"H3389\"have|strong=\"H1471\"defiled|strong=\"H2930\"your|strong=\"H7760\"holy|strong=\"H6944\"temple|strong=\"H1964\".  \nThey|strong=\"H3389\"have|strong=\"H1471\"laid|strong=\"H7760\"Jerusalem|strong=\"H3389\"in|strong=\"H1471\"heaps|strong=\"H5856\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"They|strong=\"H5414\"have|strong=\"H5650\"given|strong=\"H5414\"the|strong=\"H5414\"dead|strong=\"H5038\"bodies|strong=\"H5038\"of|strong=\"H5650\"your|strong=\"H5414\"servants|strong=\"H5650\"to|strong=\"H5414\"be|strong=\"H5414\"food|strong=\"H3978\"for|strong=\"H5650\"the|strong=\"H5414\"birds|strong=\"H5775\"of|strong=\"H5650\"the|strong=\"H5414\"sky|strong=\"H8064\",  \nthe|strong=\"H5414\"flesh|strong=\"H1320\"of|strong=\"H5650\"your|strong=\"H5414\"saints|strong=\"H2623\"to|strong=\"H5414\"the|strong=\"H5414\"animals|strong=\"H2416\"of|strong=\"H5650\"the|strong=\"H5414\"earth|strong=\"H8064\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"They|strong=\"H3389\"have|strong=\"H3389\"shed|strong=\"H8210\"their|strong=\"H5439\"blood|strong=\"H1818\"like|strong=\"H8210\"water|strong=\"H4325\"around|strong=\"H5439\"Jerusalem|strong=\"H3389\".  \nThere was|strong=\"H3389\"no|strong=\"H8210\"one|strong=\"H5439\"to|strong=\"H3389\"bury|strong=\"H6912\"them|strong=\"H5439\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"We have|strong=\"H1961\"become|strong=\"H1961\"a|strong=\"H3068\"reproach|strong=\"H2781\"to|strong=\"H1961\"our|strong=\"H1961\"neighbors|strong=\"H7934\",  \na|strong=\"H3068\"scoffing|strong=\"H3933\"and|strong=\"H5439\"derision|strong=\"H3933\"to|strong=\"H1961\"those|strong=\"H1961\"who|strong=\"H7934\"are|strong=\"H1961\"around|strong=\"H5439\"us|strong=\"H5439\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"How|strong=\"H4100\"long|strong=\"H5704\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\"?  \nWill|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H5704\"be|strong=\"H3068\"angry forever|strong=\"H5704\"?  \nWill|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"jealousy|strong=\"H7068\"burn|strong=\"H1197\"like|strong=\"H3644\"fire?   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"Pour|strong=\"H8210\"out|strong=\"H8210\"your|strong=\"H5921\"wrath|strong=\"H2534\"on|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"nations|strong=\"H1471\"that|strong=\"H3045\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\"you|strong=\"H5921\",  \non|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"kingdoms|strong=\"H4467\"that|strong=\"H3045\"don’t call|strong=\"H7121\"on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"name|strong=\"H8034\",   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"for|strong=\"H3588\"they|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3588\"devoured Jacob|strong=\"H3290\",  \nand|strong=\"H3290\"destroyed|strong=\"H8074\"his|strong=\"H3588\"homeland.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Don’t hold|strong=\"H2142\"the|strong=\"H3588\"iniquities|strong=\"H5771\"of|strong=\"H5771\"our|strong=\"H3588\"forefathers|strong=\"H7223\"against|strong=\"H3966\"us|strong=\"H3588\".  \nLet|strong=\"H2142\"your|strong=\"H3588\"tender mercies|strong=\"H7356\"speedily|strong=\"H4118\"meet|strong=\"H6923\"us|strong=\"H3588\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"we|strong=\"H3068\"are|strong=\"H7356\"in|strong=\"H2142\"desperate need.   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Help|strong=\"H5826\"us|strong=\"H5921\", God of|strong=\"H1697\"our|strong=\"H5921\"salvation|strong=\"H3468\", for|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"glory|strong=\"H3519\"of|strong=\"H1697\"your|strong=\"H5921\"name|strong=\"H8034\".  \nDeliver|strong=\"H5337\"us|strong=\"H5921\", and|strong=\"H1697\"forgive|strong=\"H3722\"our|strong=\"H5921\"sins|strong=\"H2403\", for|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"name|strong=\"H8034\"’s sake|strong=\"H4616\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"Why|strong=\"H4100\"should|strong=\"H4100\"the|strong=\"H3045\"nations|strong=\"H1471\"say, “Where|strong=\"H4100\"is|strong=\"H4100\"their|strong=\"H3045\"God?”  \nLet it|strong=\"H3045\"be|strong=\"H1471\"known|strong=\"H3045\"among the|strong=\"H3045\"nations|strong=\"H1471\", before|strong=\"H5869\"our|strong=\"H5650\"eyes|strong=\"H5869\",  \nthat|strong=\"H3045\"vengeance|strong=\"H5360\"for|strong=\"H5650\"your|strong=\"H3045\"servants|strong=\"H5650\"’ blood|strong=\"H1818\"is|strong=\"H4100\"being poured|strong=\"H8210\"out|strong=\"H8210\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Let|strong=\"H3498\"the|strong=\"H6440\"sighing of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H6440\"prisoner come before|strong=\"H6440\"you|strong=\"H6440\".  \nAccording to|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"greatness|strong=\"H1433\"of|strong=\"H1121\"your|strong=\"H6440\"power|strong=\"H2220\", preserve|strong=\"H3498\"those|strong=\"H1121\"who|strong=\"H1121\"are|strong=\"H1121\"sentenced to|strong=\"H6440\"death|strong=\"H8546\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Pay|strong=\"H7725\"back|strong=\"H7725\"to|strong=\"H7725\"our|strong=\"H7725\"neighbors|strong=\"H7934\"seven|strong=\"H7659\"times|strong=\"H7659\"into|strong=\"H7725\"their|strong=\"H7725\"bosom|strong=\"H2436\"their|strong=\"H7725\"reproach|strong=\"H2781\"with|strong=\"H7725\"which they|strong=\"H2778\"have reproached|strong=\"H2778\"you|strong=\"H7725\", Lord.   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"So|strong=\"H5608\"we|strong=\"H3068\", your|strong=\"H3034\"people|strong=\"H5971\"and|strong=\"H5971\"sheep|strong=\"H6629\"of|strong=\"H5971\"your|strong=\"H3034\"pasture|strong=\"H4830\",  \nwill|strong=\"H5971\"give|strong=\"H3034\"you|strong=\"H3034\"thanks|strong=\"H3034\"forever|strong=\"H5769\".  \nWe will|strong=\"H5971\"praise|strong=\"H8416\"you|strong=\"H3034\"forever|strong=\"H5769\", to|strong=\"H1755\"all|strong=\"H1755\"generations|strong=\"H1755\".   \n"}]}
